wave 3: installer, agent contract, onboarding prompt, web UI

T6: install.sh (dry-run-first probe: Tailscale/Docker/NVIDIA/Ollama/Hermes; seeds the registry
  with an Ollama prefill or a blank openai-compatible slot; writes the systemd user unit;
  --apply / --uninstall). check-secrets.sh (credential-pattern gate before every push).
  systemd/model-launcher.service. AGENTS.md (the full operating contract an AI agent reads to
  drive the launcher: API table, onboarding procedure, invariants, gotchas).
  docs/onboarding-agent-checklist.md (the prompt the friend pastes to his own agent).

T7: index.html web UI - engine cards from the registry, live states, effort picker, switch/preempt
  buttons, measured progress bar, GPU/RAM/Hermes pills, per-engine log view. Consumes the real
  /api/status shape. server.py journal endpoint gained a ?target= filter (per-engine unit log).
  journal_since now handles None unit/since (falls back to the generic tail).

Phase 01 of the model-launcher build complete.
